 everything going well, is it time to mingle?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Not yet. Ok. Gang. Everything looks like it is running smoothly. So this is how it is going to play out. First, we do a sweep to make sure everything is set up properly. Therefore, there are no surprises. Second, make sure we have enough food and drink for everyone. Consequently, everyone is happy. After that, shepherd Marisa. Make her feel comfortable. I'll get up and say a few words so that everyone is up to speed and then we'll bring Marisa up to say a few words. Finally, we mingle and keep guests happy. Any questions? Ok. Go to work.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>:   Adam, we need more brochures so that we can pass them out to the guests."}, {"time": "49000", "image": "engenn11le09ob10re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>:  I'll take care of it. Would you like me to copy out 20 or 50?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Copy 50 just in case we have unexpected guests.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Kristi, Marisa is here. Can you get a glass of wine for her and help her with anything she needs since she is our guest of honor. She will need to be taken care of. Where is Adam?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: He is copying brochures. Hi Marisa, you look wonderful.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Marisa</span>: Thank you!"}, {"time": "74000", "image": "engenn11le09ob10re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: So, in a little while, Denise is getting up and saying a few words in about five minutes and as you are the star of the show, we'll need you to say a few words when you are ready.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Marisa</span>: I'm so excited because this is all so new to me. I wish my father were here. He'd always help me with my writing.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Would you like a glass of wine?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Marisa</span>: Do you have anything stronger? I am very nervous. Consequently, I may need something a little stronger.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I'll get it for you."}]}}], "title": "", "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "id": 0}]}